# County Land Cover Map (R, Terra Package & Public data)

R Scipt that builds a land cover map along with coverage percentage breakdown
for any US county with NLCD data and the TERRA R package. 

Settings can be changed in the first section of the script 


## What it does" 

1. Downloads county boundary from US Census Bureau 
2. Dowloads NLCD land cover raster for the county in question 
3. Clips raster based on county outline 
4. Calcuates area and percentages based on each land cover classes 
5. Saves the grapgic as a two panel download